=== PE 889: Rational Blancmange ===

The blancmange function (also called Takagi curve) is:
  B(x) = Σ s(2^n x) / 2^n
where s(x) = distance to nearest integer.

=== Known exact values ===
  B(1/3) = B(2/3) = 2/3 ≈ 0.66666667
  B(1/5) = B(4/5) = 9/25 = 0.36
  B(2/5) = B(3/5) = 12/25 = 0.48
  B(1/7) = B(6/7) = 4/7 ≈ 0.57142857
  B(2/7) = B(5/7) = 5/7 ≈ 0.71428571
  B(3/7) = B(4/7) = 5/7 ≈ 0.71428571

=== Verification ===
  B(1/3) = 0.66666667
  B(1/5) = 0.53333333
  B(2/5) = 0.66666667
  B(1/7) = 0.44897959
  B(2/7) = 0.61224490
  B(3/7) = 0.65306122

PE answer: 424315113.00000000
